  "title": "Chinese Peppered Green Beans",
  "description": "Bright, crisp and spicy with crushed green peppercorns, fresh red chile pepper and garlic, these green beans will add lots of flavor and color to your meal. If you can&#39;t find Chinese yardlong or &#39;snake&#39; beans, then regular green beans will do just fine.",
